{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"马来西亚","country_iso":"MYS","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:53:35.535151","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MYS-HB-0018","ldc":"No","location":"砂拉越","location_norm":"砂捞越州","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"马来西亚龙山350kW光伏+储能项目","project_name_en":"Malaysia Longshan 350kW PV + BESS Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"上海电气","content":"近日，在砂拉越总理阿邦佐，中华人民共和国驻古晋总领馆总领事邢伟平等的共同见证下，由上海电气输配电工程成套有限公司承建的马来西亚龙山项目顺利完成移交工作。该项目包括 350kw太阳能电站、500kW/1MWh储能电池和3台150kw 柴油发电机及综合控制楼，由光伏和储能作为微电网系统主电源，实现不间断供电，柴油发动机作为后备电源，可无缝切换实现供电不停顿。上海电气相关负责人在仪式现场表示，将以此次合作为契机，在沙捞越政府的规划背景下，通过上海电气在新能源领域的专业与实力，进一步深化合作，为沙捞越的发展贡献更多力量。","content_sha256":"bdbf71ee4c336438262956e7c91ce5f27c798e6d5c59a256451547f6b27c82c1","id":13364,"publish_date":"2023-05-22 13:30:33","title":"海外项目传捷报！上海电气承建马来西亚龙山光伏电站项目完成移交","title_sha256":"ad67dfeb53ede33e597214adc1354ecc708a3ae018a30c8c8b6de750c0b5fbe7","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/40714.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MYS-HB-0018","capacity_details":"PV: 350kW, BESS: 500kW/1MWh","capacity_mw":0.35,"capacity_mw_raw":"0.35","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:53:35.535357","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MYS-HB-0018-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.shanghai-electric.com/group/c/2024-11-25/578573.shtml\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"沙捞越州政府","project_developer_en":"Sarawak State Government","project_stage":"竣工","project_summary":"上海电气输配电工程成套有限公司在马来西亚承建了龙山光伏电站项目，该项目包含350kW太阳能电站、500kW/1MWh储能电池和柴油发电机作为备用电源